cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MoukhlijMatExtract in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MoukhlijMatExtract (MME)"
abstract: >-
  A tool that extracts battery-materials data — solid electrolytes, cathodes and anodes — (activation
  energies, ionic and electronic conductivities, diffusion coefficients and more) from scientific papers,
  ranks the materials and classifies them by crystal and structure family.
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-08"   # TODO: set to the day the 1.1.0 release is published
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/YounesMoukhlij/MoukhlijMatExtract"
url: "https://github.com/YounesMoukhlij/MoukhlijMatExtract"
keywords:
  - solid-state electrolytes
  - cathode materials
  - anode materials
  - materials science
  - scientific literature mining
  - activation energy
  - ionic conductivity
